  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1410.19 Jumper Registration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1410.19 Jumper Registration.\n\n(a) All bungee jumpers shall supply the following information upon registering:\n\n(1) Name;\n\n(2) Address;\n\n(3) Telephone number;\n\n(4) Medical conditions;\n\n(5) Age; and\n\n(6) Written parental consent, if the jumper is age 16 or 17.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400) #5607, eff 4-2-93, EXPIRED: 4-2-99\n\nNew. #7000, eff 5-25-99 EXPIRED: 5-25-07\n\nNew. #8964, INTERIM, eff 8-20-07; ss by #9079, eff 1-28-08; ss by #11151, eff 8-11-16; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
